# Inference is configured centrally — set NEBIUS_API_KEY in the repo-root compute.env (see COMPUTE.md).

# Agent model: YOUR choice (run_game.py refuses to guess). Either pass --models on the command
# line or set MODEL_NAME here. For example:
#   deepseek/deepseek-r1-0528   closest to the paper (full R1): slow, reasoning model
#   qwen/qwen3-14b              hybrid reasoning model, thinks by default: cheap tokens
#   openai/gpt-4.1-mini         non-reasoning, fast: best for iterating (--think for inspectable thoughts)
# MODEL_NAME=qwen/qwen3-14b

# Judge model (judges/api_judge.py) defaults to qwen/qwen3-14b, like the paper's Qwen judge.
# A 300-round duopoly = 600 calls; reasoning models also bill thinking tokens. Start with --rounds 30.
